Package: dtpsig
Title: Drug-Tolerant Persister Signature Scoring and Survival Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yousef", "Elabd", email = "yousefehab1974@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scores gene expression signatures (ssGSEA) across CRC and pan-cancer
    TCGA cohorts, runs survival and differential-expression analyses against a
    configurable, data-driven gene signature panel, and reports results as
    publication figures, a single Excel workbook, and an interactive dashboard.
